WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.102
AJAK
Five years ago, Thanos erased

00:00:02.152 --> 00:00:03.503
half of the universe.

00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:07.721
But the people of this planet
brought everyone back

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:10.081
with the snap of a finger.

00:00:11.097 --> 00:00:13.805
Humanity once
believed we were gods.

00:00:15.197 --> 00:00:17.746
With what this
planet now faces,

00:00:17.797 --> 00:00:19.247
they will believe again.

00:00:20.024 --> 00:00:21.355
IKARIS
Eternals assemble.

00:00:22.074 --> 00:00:23.148
DRUIG
What's the plan?

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:25.078
THENA
We fight.

